---
title: "deposit_collateral - Deposit Collateral to Obligation (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_check_lock: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert

    q_check_lock --> q_check_active: obligation not locked
    q_check_lock --> q_error_locked: obligation locked (staked in borrow incentive)
    q_error_locked --> [*]: revert 770

    q_check_active --> q_check_type: collateral type is active
    q_check_active --> q_error_inactive: collateral not active
    q_error_inactive --> [*]: revert 73730

    q_check_type --> q_check_not_borrowed: validate collateral type registered
    q_check_type --> q_error_type: invalid collateral type
    q_error_type --> [*]: revert 1794

    q_check_not_borrowed --> q_check_cap: coin type != any borrowed type in obligation
    q_check_not_borrowed --> q_error_same_asset: depositor tries to deposit same asset as borrowed
    q_error_same_asset --> [*]: revert 1796

    q_check_cap --> q_deposit: collateral_cap not reached
    q_check_cap --> q_error_cap: collateral capacity exceeded
    q_error_cap --> [*]: revert

    q_deposit --> q_update: obligation.collaterals[T] += coin.value
    q_update --> q_emit: store coin in obligation
    q_emit --> [*]: emit CollateralDepositEvent

    note right of q_check_not_borrowed
        INV-001: a collateral type T cannot be the same as any borrowed type in the obligation
        INV-002: anyone can deposit collateral into any obligation (no ObligationKey required)
    end note

    note right of q_update
        INV-003: obligation.collaterals[T] after = obligation.collaterals[T] before + coin.value
        INV-004: total collateral for type T <= collateral_cap for T
    end note
